{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.MarkovTraceH4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.MarkovTraceH4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Pi","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.BilinearTraceCyclicity"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_cyclic_of_gram_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_cyclic_of_gram_symm","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L160-L171","doc":"**(M2) Cyclicity from Gram symmetry** — the Fin-24-**free** reduction of trace\ncyclicity to symmetry of the Gram matrix `G_{i,j} = tr_M(b_i·b_j)`.  A direct\ninstance of the level-agnostic `BilinearTrace.cyclic_of_gram_symm`: `mulNF` is\n`R`-bilinear (with `mulσ` opaque, so the depth-6 `whnf` wall is untouched) and\n`trM` is `R`-linear, so given `G` symmetric, `tr_M(u·v) = tr_M(v·u)` for all `u,v`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.e","kind":"def","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L156-L158","doc":"The standard basis vector `e i = b_i` (the `i`-th NF basis element).\nDefinitionally `QOU.Machinery.BilinearTrace.e i` at `ι = Fin 24`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_zero_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_zero_left","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L153-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_smul_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_smul_right","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L149-L152","doc":"`mulNF` is homogeneous in its right argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_smul_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_smul_left","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L145-L148","doc":"`mulNF` is homogeneous in its left argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_add_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_add_right","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L141-L144","doc":"`mulNF` is additive in its right argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_add_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF_add_left","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L137-L140","doc":"`mulNF` is additive in its left argument (`mulσ` kept opaque). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_zero","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L135-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_zero","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L134-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_zero","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L133-L133","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_smul","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L131-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_smul","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L129-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_smul","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L127-L128","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2_add","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L125-L126","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1_add","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L123-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0_add","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L121-L122","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_markov_σ2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_markov_σ2","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L103-L110","doc":"**(M3) Markov reduction** — `tr_M(x · σ₂) = z · tr_M(x)` for `x ∈ H₃`\n(the parabolic `⟨σ₀,σ₁⟩`, NF indices `{0,2,3,7,8,13}`).  This is the base case\nfor the general-`n` Markov stabilization (τ-functor open item A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_smul","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L97-L101","doc":"(M1) Homogeneity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM_add","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L92-L95","doc":"(M1) Additivity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L64-L90","doc":"The full algebra product `u · v` on the NF module: `∑_j v_j · (u · b_j)`,\n`u · b_j` = the composite of `mulσ` along the reduced word of `b_j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ2","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L61-L62","doc":"Right action of `σ₂` (the top strand — the Markov generator) on the NF basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ1","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L58-L59","doc":"Right action of `σ₁` on the NF basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ0","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L55-L56","doc":"Right action of `σ₀` on the NF basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The Markov trace as the linear functional `v ↦ ∑ᵢ vᵢ · TRMᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.TRM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.TRM","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/MarkovTraceH4.lean#L49-L50","doc":"Markov-trace values on the 24 NF basis elements of `H₄(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}